sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Caregiver
    participant AG as API Gateway
    participant CS as Care Service
    participant NATS as NATS Event Bus

    %% View pending bookings
    C->>AG: GET {baseUrl}/care/booking
    AG->>CS: Fetch caregiver bookings
    CS-->>AG: Pending bookings (or error)
    AG-->>C: Show list

    %% Decide on booking
    C->>AG: PUT {baseUrl}/care/booking
    AG->>CS: Update booking status
    alt Approve
        CS-->>AG: Status=approved
        AG-->>C: Confirm approved
        AG->>NATS: Publish "BookingApproved"
    else Reject
        CS-->>AG: Status=rejected
        AG-->>C: Confirm rejected
        AG->>NATS: Publish "BookingRejected"
    else Failure
        CS-->>AG: 500 Error
        AG-->>C: Error message
    end
